---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
---
<BaseLayout title="Private Group Travel | Talon Expeditions" description="Custom, fully supported private group travel for clubs, communities, businesses, studios, affinity groups and organizers." image={images.group}>
  <section class="page-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.group}')`}><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Private group travel</p><h1 class="section-title">Build a trip around the people you are bringing together.</h1><p>Custom group travel for clubs, communities, businesses, studios, affinity groups, friends, and organizers who want more support than a standard package.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell content-split"><aside class="side-card"><p class="eyebrow">Start planning</p><h2>You do not need a finished itinerary.</h2><p>Bring us the group, the shared interest, or the kind of experience you want to create.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Plan a Group Trip</a></aside><div class="prose"><h2>A group trip should feel like it belongs to the group.</h2><p>Private group travel is the center of the Talon Expeditions model. Rather than asking your people to fit into a generic departure, we shape the trip around who is traveling, what they want to do, the pace they can realistically manage, and the support the organizer needs.</p><h3>Who we build for</h3><ul><li>Outdoor, hiking, trekking, and adventure clubs</li><li>Dive, sailing, surf, and watersports communities</li><li>Wellness, yoga, movement, and studio groups</li><li>Social clubs, affinity communities, alumni, and friends</li><li>Businesses and team groups</li><li>Organizers creating a hosted departure for their own audience</li></ul><h3>What Talon can coordinate</h3><p>Trip design, destination research, flights, lodging, activities, local operators, transport, traveler communications, trip readiness, and the practical structure required to move a group from interest to departure.</p><h3>Support for the organizer</h3><p>The organizer should not have to become a full-time travel coordinator. We help shape the offer, clarify what is included, organize the moving parts, and give participants a clearer path from interest to prepared traveler.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
